{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1501825-vampire-5th-edition-character-creator","id":1501825,"title":"Vampire 5th Edition Character Creator","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-01-31T12:15:25-08:00","id":1501825,"title":"Vampire 5th Edition Character Creator","content":"Hey all, been working on a pet project over the past month or so and have it in a somewhat presentable state. My tool, SchreckNet will allow you to create, save and export to PDF (Nerdbert's sheets) RAW 5th edition vampires and hunters. It should hopefully be a boon to STs, new and old players alike. You can make your chars for play, or as an ST easily find NPCs that fit your story and generate sheets for them.<br /> <br /> It still needs some additional testing but for the most part should work fine. I'm waiting for the players guide before I bust out the free-form creator as I expect we're going to get a number of new mechanics/features. Please let me know if you have any issues.<br /> <br /> Link to site: <a href=\"https://www.schrecknet.live/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.schrecknet.live/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27749-welard","name":"Welard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-02T02:54:01-08:00","id":1501939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Welard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1501825-vampire-5th-edition-character-creator#post1501825\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey all, been working on a pet project over the past month or so and have it in a somewhat presentable state. My tool, SchreckNet will allow you to create, save and export to PDF (Nerdbert's sheets) RAW 5th edition vampires and hunters. It should hopefully be a boon to STs, new and old players alike. You can make your chars for play, or as an ST easily find NPCs that fit your story and generate sheets for them.<br /> <br /> It still needs some additional testing but for the most part should work fine. I'm waiting for the players guide before I bust out the free-form creator as I expect we're going to get a number of new mechanics/features. Please let me know if you have any issues.<br /> <br /> Link to site: <a href=\"https://www.schrecknet.live/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.schrecknet.live/</a></div> </div> </div> </div>This is neat. If you ever do one for V20 (which in some ways, should be easier), let me know. I'm more likely to need NPCs for that, but I can convert from V5 with a little work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-07T05:05:43-08:00","id":1502378,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1501825-vampire-5th-edition-character-creator?p=1501939#post1501939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is neat. If you ever do one for V20 (which in some ways, should be easier), let me know. I'm more likely to need NPCs for that, but I can convert from V5 with a little work.</div> </div> </div> </div>I eventually am planning to get onto that. Waiting for Werewolf and the players guide for v5 to round out some things as well as confirmation from Paradox that I am legally okay to make v20 stuff under the dark pack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27749-welard","name":"Welard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-28T06:28:30-07:00","id":1506746,"title":"","content":"Hey all, posting with some updates. The site has been completely updated to the new player's guide which includes lots of new merits, loresheets, alternative banes, predator types and a bunch more. Some other background stuff has been included as well such as HtR 5 and a search function.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27749-welard","name":"Welard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-29T16:22:13-07:00","id":1506880,"title":"","content":"Wow, that's pretty awesome! Nicely done! I know Nerberts sheets are pretty cool, so glad you were able to use em..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-31T10:33:20-07:00","id":1507059,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1501825-vampire-5th-edition-character-creator?p=1506880#post1506880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow, that's pretty awesome! Nicely done! I know Nerberts sheets are pretty cool, so glad you were able to use em..</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you! I love his sheets and he was a big help in updating his sheets to make them programmatically fillable. Big thanks to him and his support.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27749-welard","name":"Welard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-31T14:48:34-07:00","id":1507082,"title":"","content":"It is nice and great to see good work done in regard to support for VtM - clearly one of most interesting and best RPGs out there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-02T14:09:59-07:00","id":1507213,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1501825-vampire-5th-edition-character-creator?p=1507082#post1507082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is nice and great to see good work done in regard to support for VtM - clearly one of most interesting and best RPGs out there.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll be supporting every 5e line as they come out. HtR is already done and I'll be doing Werewolf as soon as it is possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27749-welard","name":"Welard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-26T14:43:24-07:00","id":1512913,"title":"","content":"Hello all, I've added support for the various Hecata bloodlines to SchreckNet - (Giovanni, Lamiae, Nagaraja and Samedi). Sorry this took so long, they will be treated as their own clans though will still inherit all the typical Hecata banes, compulsions etc. I decided to make them their own clan to offer better long-term support in the case that White Wolf fleshes these bloodlines out more. (They might come blood sigils this summer)<br /> <br /> Anyhow, please let me know if you experience any issues. I'll be working on a city generator/court generator using our player-generated kindred soon followed by blood sigil updates this summer. WtA support will come in August as soon as I can finish speed reading the book and programming the rules.<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27749-welard","name":"Welard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-07T09:11:46-07:00","id":1520041,"title":"","content":"Updated to support WtA!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27749-welard","name":"Welard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-26T12:14:05-07:00","id":1551298,"title":"","content":"Just posting to say we are fully up to date with all 5th edition lines. In Memorium and Apostates content included.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.schrecknet.live/game/find\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oKT0nQ0.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.schrecknet.live/game/find\" target=\"_blank\"> SchreckNet </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.schrecknet.live/game/find\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.schrecknet.live/game/find </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> A World of Darkness character creator, manager and exporter. We offer characters from Vampire: The Masquerade, Werewolf: The Apocalypse, Hunter: The Reckoning and many other White Wolf RPG lines. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I also released a game finder feature today which includes all editions and WoD lines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27749-welard","name":"Welard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}